<title>USA: Valero says restructuring &quot;on schedule&quot;.</title>
<headline>Valero says restructuring &quot;on schedule&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valero Energy Corp said Tuesday it is on schedule to complete its restructuring by mid-year.</p>
<p>Valero Chairman and Chief Executive Bill Greehey also said in a statement that its efforts to select a merger partner for its natural gas-related services business &quot;are progressing smoothly.&quot;</p>
<p>In November, Valero's board approved a company recommendation to review strategic alternatives, including seeking an alliance for its natural gas related services unit and a likely spinoff of its refining and marketing operation.</p>
</text>
